{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25169287542680910", "organization": {"id": "608197834364884", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "8714253315313680"}]}, "id": "736023364813844"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "25169287542680910"}]}, "id": "2212796615914895"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "4038407439503919"}]}, "id": "172103444351718"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "25169287542680910", "release_date": 1772733300, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26086591190950536"}, "id": "1342327354286030"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1773412550, "id": "26049708177972171", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v10", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 10, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "26049708157972173"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "25169287542680910"}, "id": "26049708157972173", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "25169287542680910", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "830516066436772"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1830271867683818", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Le Dino Labo", "keywords": ["rompecabezas", "educaci\u00f3n", "dinosaurio", "prehist\u00f3rico", "realidadmixta"], "long_description": "Bienvenido a **Le Dino Labo**, un juego de rompecabezas de realidad mixta en el que se reconstruyen dinosaurios prehist\u00f3ricos hueso a hueso en tu propio espacio. \ud83e\uddb4\ud83e\udd96\n\nDise\u00f1ado para los aficionados a los **rompecabezas en 3D, los dinosaurios y el descubrimiento pr\u00e1ctico**, esta experiencia te permite examinar fragmentos de f\u00f3siles, comprender c\u00f3mo encajan los esqueletos y montar cuidadosamente criaturas legendarias.\n\n{26285219827736399}\n\nUna vez completado, obs\u00e9rvalos aparecer a **escala real** en tu propio entorno. \u00a1Haz clic en \u00abm\u00e1s\u00bb para ver m\u00e1s! \ud83d\ude42\n\n{1391472875491115}\n\n>\n\n# \ud83d\udca1M\u00faltiples niveles de dificultad\n{1361957705620129}\nCada dinosaurio presenta **m\u00faltiples niveles de dificultad**, lo que permite a los jugadores elegir entre un montaje m\u00e1s guiado o una reconstrucci\u00f3n m\u00e1s desafiante, al estilo de los expertos. \n>\n\n# \ud83e\udde0 Aprende mientras construyes\n{2123306585096587}\nA medida que construyes, **se revela progresivamente informaci\u00f3n cient\u00edfica**.\n>\n\n# \ud83e\udd95 Acerca del lanzamiento inicial\n\n- La **colecci\u00f3n inicial incluye 5 rompecabezas ic\u00f3nicos de dinosaurios**, cada uno con su propia escala, anatom\u00eda y dificultad de montaje.\n- Se lanzar\u00e1n **paquetes adicionales de rompecabezas de dinosaurios** como contenido descargable, con **nuevas caracter\u00edsticas y dinosaurios a\u00f1adidos a trav\u00e9s de actualizaciones peri\u00f3dicas**, ampliando la experiencia con el tiempo.\n>\n\n# \ud83e\udd96 \u00danete a nuestro Discord para descubrir los pr\u00f3ximos dinosaurios, seguir las nuevas caracter\u00edsticas y conectar con la comunidad.\n\ud83d\udc49 bit.ly/ledinolabo", "short_description": "Le Dino Labo es un rompecabezas 3D de realidad mixta en el que reconstruyes esqueletos de dinosaurios hueso a hueso en tu propio espacio. Monta dinosaurios emblem\u00e1ticos a escala real y disfruta de una experiencia de juego XR pr\u00e1ctica. Incluye 5 dinosaurios en el lanzamiento, con paquetes adicionales disponibles como DLC. \ud83e\udd96"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "dino_Comme_B_3000x900.png", "id": "4657409647822339", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820923_4657409651155672_5495412209659722134_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7OIKa2cFttgQ7kNvwFkFhUA&_nc_oc=Adl0bOyU1glNr7yiIQc1i93Qu5B3efJRAXdHMG0nKh4DiU7Zv2eSS04F1UyJyjgmJIw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyfBKcCcKa4mCLmK6rxHrSWDS6X7K_OohLgSlI_AykbKg&oe=69BFCAFE"}, {"file_name": "LE_DINO_LABO_Come_2 2560.png", "id": "1873807910002385", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_1873807913335718_685856277878621326_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dCGAA02ojHwQ7kNvwHQwiVj&_nc_oc=AdkTEFer6mDWnqKFeLBgTKtxCMoVCIaRvUvBeZ4pl77QSBcTyBbNBxKTkblQjp0Nomo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzqEQhSru3tzAtdj3TcamHii56mwo7QrZePf8tsX2jteA&oe=69BFFDD7"}, {"file_name": "dino_Comme_B_1440x1440.png", "id": "1584303249565485", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821755_1584303252898818_6265626410601799152_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cieMJRsWo80Q7kNvwFzJvSl&_nc_oc=AdnHA_M9bpuxUr-0lYvAmyhLmbiln7jF5281xNtdAhi_wpeVSHy8ASrw38VZiMPcOiw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwgdWZPHBMjD1AskFoQQmw-LrE0JOKU18a02ZuvO5AFqQ&oe=69BFCAD9"}, {"file_name": "dino_Comme_B_512x512.png", "id": "1551846869260225", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_1551846879260224_3018189632487145242_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=svlvIFGcDB0Q7kNvwHu8zLN&_nc_oc=Adn0smp34ko7PK-jIog8LGiz5HS7o_hO2lDTZQ2nue7tsrMRmILDfgjdZ1kv5b90ER4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwKJIQkBTlQx1yQLt7m00e_MB50hKQQAeAKQZ_17LFBZA&oe=69BFF852"}, {"file_name": "dino_Comme_B_1008x1440.png", "id": "1443847993398415", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_1443847996731748_1448474798022404656_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WKFZP8cGB6QQ7kNvwERRa3y&_nc_oc=Adn3KA27iA7rXQHTBhxkovUjzoJqWZfRSGAZXMOds9j8DE7JWMuEg2JqHgJTj6hDIgU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwpGFMXAnUPRb9IcvSudQHyWzNHHg1N-A9YPGKCG3Byfg&oe=69BFD453"}, {"file_name": "dino_Comme_Squer_Titel.png", "id": "1197400915829121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824741_1197400919162454_936127185576035333_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Yiy-m6MM8vMQ7kNvwH1fVfM&_nc_oc=AdlQTa8BgE7csVf-m1B8UKd3rXof1iwfmdWWBxQV489voV7k-_1nXhc2Elr9mHRlhWM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyokKAb6vKoesjNDPDYbAFb8X7jsAKNEtX-pJZGoNlDug&oe=69BFDEEA"}]}, "id": "1699125341466984", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "TRex_Building_Hugo.png", "id": "1930352171207264", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_1930352174540597_3763287172082205481_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=huXysMOGP0UQ7kNvwFNR_bx&_nc_oc=AdkVq6WEfJKKOG9A_BOaTqUaB5T-dGByqmNma8S7FvxxnmNP-DRRPoqEqugnDjfhcw4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz6iO35DGIR5wmqYC7o4nVVN08ygYnol6jmGoLJTyTycg&oe=69BFCD2B"}, {"file_name": "Parasaurolophus_Building_Hugo.png", "id": "2338868219947358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825503_2338868223280691_1441387049040341057_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n6LuOpRkJDkQ7kNvwHvrEDH&_nc_oc=AdmlAIkFaI8HB_rxjgXUO4a9OfNvvikdrV5za1ASQyQzeype1KEzkSgzLEtcmI2TgM8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwx7jpQEXqOM5kzzwhhXLfBZL51vdaqMGHXd7R_b3Q-Xg&oe=69BFD06D"}, {"file_name": "Spino_VR.png", "id": "2144274133082934", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_2144274136416267_1091953191402992867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=crngN1kDXHAQ7kNvwFTqaZW&_nc_oc=AdlLGypV9UV5GL4eGduN5PPLceB7JIhf-6Ea5M4y820KwuU288ckWstOjcnoTObHBxY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxFuQQNKjn_BXtiQQHllhlGJf1GAphR6XaGGQuC9jQz7A&oe=69BFFF2F"}, {"file_name": "2 trex plantes detail.png", "id": "2024087444805463", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820441_2024087448138796_512112542256273270_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z2MEhFMV4EMQ7kNvwEyoOBf&_nc_oc=AdlUKJEyQLFtpoGAeVpLS98efW8upfwx0-KlVdRTZoIQY-TyZs6fwkB7SfOZBK6G8Lo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyqYhpt7jELXTmbvBo-RhDa-B2LU9b-icTNsBpFi-alaw&oe=69BFDB36"}, {"file_name": "1 trex troca.png", "id": "1330523669102972", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_1330523672436305_9000464861639034881_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yRpTrj2dgz8Q7kNvwH_v7hf&_nc_oc=AdkH7qbgZp6XTJO6TBmGx7rHi1wI3b_k8_ryl23VeLsXQAiOa_0UBCbHf_QFe_QLoaY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afym0HeyJzU027EP2Rfu1UKjai7gfnOS578g_xDNqp_cBg&oe=69BFFD4C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "dino_Comme_2560x1440 best.png", "id": "1390044829484265", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821704_1390044832817598_7314245579331429285_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=85X51y0LUl8Q7kNvwGuKB_r&_nc_oc=Adl34pqbWOaEZ9zH6Euv2zhAGiGcYZBZmypO90UBxidKl_TLZOiKcIS4vtQ8T0lTLOA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxCy2KyuZldJLr2JbXI8z7fMwZt44eKWKXuobKoHJ4jCw&oe=69BFF2B5"}, "display_name": "Le Dino Labo", "keywords": ["puzzle", "education", "dinosaur", "prehistoric", "trex"], "long_description": "# **Bring dinosaurs back to life in your own space. \ud83e\udd96**\nAssemble giant skeletons **bone by bone** in a hands-on mixed-reality puzzle featuring **dinosaurs and other prehistoric creatures.**\n\nBegin with **5 iconic species** and grow your lab with new discoveries.\n>\n# \ud83e\uddb4 Turn your room into a dinosaur lab.\n{1988424452556026}\nRebuild prehistoric giants **bone by bone** in mixed reality.\n\n>\n\n# \ud83d\udccf Life-Size Dinosaur Reveal\n{2799642560387035}\nOnce completed, watch them appear at **full, life-size scale** in your own environment.\n>\n\n# \ud83d\udca1Multiple Difficulty Levels\n\n{2144406449672040}\n\nEach species includes **three levels of complexity**, letting you choose between a more accessible puzzle or a deeper reconstruction challenge.\n\n>\n\n# \ud83e\udde0 Learn as You Build\n\n{1381198063762243}\n\nAs each bone finds its place, **scientific insights appear**, revealing how dinosaur skeletons were structured and discovered.\n>\n\n# \ud83e\udd95 Launch Creatures\nStart with **5 iconic prehistoric species** including **Tyrannosaurus Rex and Pteranodon.**\n\nNew creature packs will expand the lab with **more species and discoveries.**\n>\n\n# \ud83d\udcac Join our Discord \nFollow upcoming dinosaurs, share feedback, and connect with other players.\n\n**\ud83d\udc49 bit.ly/ledinolabo**\n", "short_description": "Bring prehistoric giants back to life in your room. \ud83e\udd96\nAssemble giant skeletons bone by bone in a hands-on mixed-reality puzzle featuring dinosaurs and other prehistoric creatures.\nBegin with 5 iconic species and grow your lab with new discoveries."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "896956169912034", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Le Dino Labo", "keywords": ["Puzzle", "Pr\u00e4historisch", "Dinosaurier", "Lernspiel", "Trex"], "long_description": "Willkommen bei **Le Dino Labo**, einem Mixed-Reality-Puzzlespiel, in dem du pr\u00e4historische Dinosaurier **Knochen f\u00fcr Knochen in deinem eigenen Raum** wieder aufbaust. \ud83e\uddb4\ud83e\udd96\n\nUntersuche Fossilien, entdecke, wie Skelette zusammenpassen, und setze legend\u00e4re Kreaturen zusammen \u2013 perfekt f\u00fcr Fans von **3D-Puzzles und Dinosauriern**.\n\n{1656217342479611}\n\nSobald Sie fertig sind, k\u00f6nnen Sie sie in **voller, realer Gr\u00f6\u00dfe** in Ihrer eigenen Umgebung betrachten. Klicken Sie auf \u201eMehr\u201c, um mehr zu sehen! \ud83d\ude42\n\n\n{2753742471630236}\n>\n\n# \ud83d\udca1Mehrere Schwierigkeitsstufen\n\n{1260645705466999}\n\nJeder Dinosaurier verf\u00fcgt \u00fcber **mehrere Schwierigkeitsstufen**, sodass die Spieler zwischen einem eher gef\u00fchrten Zusammenbau oder einer anspruchsvolleren Rekonstruktion im Expertenstil w\u00e4hlen k\u00f6nnen.\n>\n\n# \ud83e\udde0 Lernen Sie beim Bauen\n\n{953917406974136}\n\nW\u00e4hrend Sie bauen, werden **nach und nach wissenschaftliche Informationen** angezeigt, die Ihnen helfen, die Anatomie, die Proportionen und den Aufbau der einzelnen Skelette zu verstehen.\n>\n\n# \ud83e\udd95 \u00dcber die erste Ver\u00f6ffentlichung\n\n- Die **Startkollektion umfasst 5 legend\u00e4re Dinosaurier-Puzzles**, die sich jeweils in Gr\u00f6\u00dfe, Anatomie und Schwierigkeitsgrad unterscheiden.\n- **Zus\u00e4tzliche Dinosaurier-Puzzle-Pakete** werden als DLC ver\u00f6ffentlicht, wobei **durch regelm\u00e4\u00dfige Updates neue Funktionen und Dinosaurier hinzugef\u00fcgt werden**, um das Erlebnis im Laufe der Zeit zu erweitern.\n>\n\n# \ud83e\udd96 Treten Sie unserem Discord bei, um kommende Dinosaurier zu entdecken, neue Funktionen zu verfolgen und sich mit der Community zu verbinden.\n\ud83d\udc49 bit.ly/ledinolabo\n\n\n", "short_description": "Le Dino Labo ist ein Mixed-Reality-3D-Puzzle, bei dem du Dinosaurierskelette Knochen f\u00fcr Knochen in deinem eigenen Raum zusammensetzt.\nBaue legend\u00e4re Dinosaurier in Originalgr\u00f6\u00dfe und erlebe ein interaktives XR-Abenteuer. Zum Start sind 5 Dinosaurier enthalten, weitere Dino-Pakete sind als DLC verf\u00fcgbar. \ud83e\udd96"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "773656772131859", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Le Dino Labo", "keywords": ["puzzle", "\u00e9ducation", "dinosaure", "pr\u00e9historique", "trex"], "long_description": "Bienvenue dans **Le Dino Labo**, un jeu de puzzle en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 mixte o\u00f9 vous reconstituez des dinosaures pr\u00e9historiques os par os dans votre propre espace. \ud83e\uddb4\ud83e\udd96\n\nCon\u00e7ue pour les amateurs de **puzzles 3D et de dinosaures**, cette exp\u00e9rience vous permet d'examiner des fragments de fossiles et de reconstituer minutieusement ces cr\u00e9atures l\u00e9gendaires.\n\n{2710108072679241}\n\nUne fois termin\u00e9, regardez-les appara\u00eetre \u00e0 **taille r\u00e9elle** dans votre propre environnement. Cliquez sur \u00ab plus \u00bb pour en voir davantage ! \ud83d\ude42\n\n{879657754907739}\n>\n# \ud83d\udca1Plusieurs niveaux de difficult\u00e9\n\n{753683057804883}\nChaque dinosaure propose **plusieurs niveaux de difficult\u00e9**, permettant aux joueurs de choisir entre un assemblage plus guid\u00e9 ou une reconstruction plus complexe. \n>\n# \ud83e\udde0 Apprenez tout en construisant\n\n{1453182963109643}\nAu fur et \u00e0 mesure que vous construisez, **des informations scientifiques sont r\u00e9v\u00e9l\u00e9es progressivement**.\n>\n\n# \ud83e\udd95 \u00c0 propos du jeu initial\n- **La collection de lancement comprend 5 puzzles** de dinosaures iconiques, chacun offrant sa propre \u00e9chelle, anatomie et difficult\u00e9 d'assemblage.\n- Des **packs de puzzles de dinosaures suppl\u00e9mentaires** seront publi\u00e9s sous forme de DLC, avec de **nouvelles fonctionnalit\u00e9s et de nouveaux dinosaures ajout\u00e9s r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement**, enrichissant ainsi l'exp\u00e9rience au fil du temps.\n>\n\n# \ud83e\udd96 Rejoignez notre Discord pour d\u00e9couvrir les prochains dinosaures, suivre les nouvelles fonctionnalit\u00e9s et entrer en contact avec la communaut\u00e9.\n\ud83d\udc49 bit.ly/ledinolabo\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "The Dino Labo est un puzzle 3D en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 mixte o\u00f9 vous reconstituez des squelettes de dinosaures os par os dans votre propre espace. Assemblez des dinosaures embl\u00e9matiques \u00e0 taille r\u00e9elle et vivez une exp\u00e9rience de jeu XR immersive. Le jeu comprend 5 dinosaures \u00e0 son lancement, avec des packs suppl\u00e9mentaires disponibles en DLC. \ud83e\udd96"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://realcast.io/privacy-2/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Realcast Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://realcast.io/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["PUZZLE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "es", "de"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26049708157972173"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821755_1584303252898818_6265626410601799152_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cieMJRsWo80Q7kNvwFzJvSl&_nc_oc=AdnHA_M9bpuxUr-0lYvAmyhLmbiln7jF528